WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Gentle music. The $2 you did not spend is worth recording too.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Give little savings a direction. Headphone wish: $128 / $200, 64%.

00:09.000 --> 00:18.000
Tap ＋, enter 2, then tap ✓ to save. Soft tap sounds.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
Coin sound. The wish reaches $130 / $200, 65%. The pig responds to the saved record.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Record a little. Bring a wish a little closer. Go at your own pace.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.005
Wallehog 1.0. Free Android download. Self-reported savings, not bank deposits.
